@page "/"
@attribute [Authorize]

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>SQL authentication learning app</h1>

<p class="lead">You are authenticated with a user stored in SQL Server.</p>

<div class="card">
	<div class="card-body">
		<h2 class="h5">What this sample demonstrates</h2>
		<ul class="mb-0">
			<li>EF Core with SQL Server migrations.</li>
			<li>Salted PBKDF2 password hashes stored in the database.</li>
			<li>ASP.NET Core cookie authentication and role authorization.</li>
			<li>A protected Blazor CRUD page backed by SQL Server.</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</div>
